scenario bat sensor unplugged and replugged while someone is present
selector clear
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
hand 1
wait 5
remember spent
sensor 0
within 1.3 state == FAULT      # 1 s without a valid frame
expect level >= floor
wait 3
expect level == floor          # FAULT: floor while present, never below
expect needle == 2             # parked on the FAULT tick
expect spent > @spent          # the lamp is still charged while the sensor is gone
sensor 1
within 1.4 state == LIT        # clears 1 s after the first good frame (I5)
wait 2
expect level > floor
